1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,533
Jason said, Missed our floor. Lucia
said, Why did it stop where the money

2
00:00:06,533 --> 00:00:07,000
stopped?

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,667
He said, Broken cable. She said, New
floor numbers. Somebody changed the

4
00:00:11,667 --> 00:00:14,000
buttons after they arranged our pickup.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,056
Jason said, They want us downstairs.
Lucia said, They want us opening that

6
00:00:19,056 --> 00:00:21,000
case inside a locked office.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:28,000
He said, We take the stairs. She said,
First we find an open landing.

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,421
They pressed the blank service button.
The lift dropped one level, where

9
00:00:32,421 --> 00:00:35,000
wet footprints led toward the laundry
exit.

10
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,158
Jason said, Now we open it. Lucia said,
Not until you check the handle.

11
00:00:40,158 --> 00:00:42,000
That's our old luggage seal.

12
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:46,667
The case held their payment, untouched.
The hotel office above held the

13
00:00:46,667 --> 00:00:49,000
buyer's creditors, behind a bolted door.

14
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:54,158
Jason said, He paid us to arrive late.
Lucia said, Then let's be excellent

15
00:00:54,158 --> 00:00:56,000
at our jobs for once.
